Fix the following CTL2 Denormalizer transform so that it compiles and does what the specification says. List every problem you fix with the reason, then give the complete corrected code.

Input port 0:
```xml
<Metadata id="input1">
<Record name="Input1" type="delimited">
  <Field name="pass" type="string" nullable="false" delimiter=";"/>
  <Field name="ping_at" type="date" nullable="false" delimiter=";"/>
  <Field name="annotation" type="string" nullable="true" delimiter=";"/>
  <Field name="depth" type="number" nullable="true" delimiter=";"/>
</Record>
</Metadata>
```
Output port 0:
```xml
<Metadata id="output1">
<Record name="Output1" type="delimited">
  <Field name="pass" type="string" nullable="false" delimiter=";"/>
  <Field name="regressions" type="long" nullable="false" delimiter=";"/>
  <Field name="deep_frames" type="integer" nullable="false" delimiter=";"/>
  <Field name="annotated" type="integer" nullable="false" delimiter=";"/>
</Record>
</Metadata>
```

Specification:
1. Summarize non-empty sonar-survey passes grouped contiguously by pass. All ping_at values are strictly later than 2000-01-01 UTC.
2. regressions counts pings strictly earlier than the immediately preceding ping within the same pass. The first ping of every pass is not reversed; equality is not reversed.
3. deep_frames counts non-null depth strictly above 50.0; null depth contributes zero.
4. Collect every non-null annotation, including empty strings and duplicates, and emit their count as annotated. Copy pass unchanged and emit one row per pass.
5. Clear per-pass counts, annotation collection and previous-ping history before processing the next pass.

```ctl
//#CTL2
integer frames;
date previousPing;
long regressions;
string[] annotated;
function integer append() {
    boolean reversed = $in.0.ping_at < previousPing;
    previousPing = $in.0.ping_at;
    if (reversed) regressions++;
    if ($in.0.annotation != null) append(annotated, $in.0.annotation);
    if ($in.0.depth > 50.0) frames++;
    return OK;
}
function integer transform() {
    $out.0.pass = $in.0.pass;
    $out.0.regressions = regressions + 1L;
    $out.0.deep_frames = frames;
    $out.0.annotated = size(annotated);
    return ALL;
}
function void clean() { frames = 0; regressions = 0L; clear(annotated); }
```

