Specification:
1. Group non-empty election tally-packet streams by precinct; received_at is strictly after 2000-01-01 UTC.
2. backward_packets counts timestamps strictly earlier than the immediately preceding packet in the precinct, irrespective of whether either packet has a note. The first packet is not backward.
3. packets is the number of input packets; ballots is the sum of ballots, where null ballots contributes zero.
4. Count all non-null note fields, preserving empty notes and duplicates. Emit one summary row with the unchanged precinct key.
5. Reset all precinct state, including previous timestamp, before the next precinct.

```ctl
//#CTL2
integer packets;
date previousReceipt;
decimal ballots;
long backwardPackets;
string[] notes;
function integer append() {
    boolean backward = $in.0.received_at < previousReceipt;
    if (backward) backwardPackets++;
    if ($in.0.note != null) {
        append(notes, $in.0.note);
        previousReceipt = $in.0.received_at;
    }
    ballots = ballots + $in.0.ballots;
    packets++;
    return OK;
}
function integer transform() {
    $out.0.precinct = $in.0.precinct;
    $out.0.packets = packets - 1;
    $out.0.ballots = ballots;
    $out.0.backward_packets = backwardPackets;
    $out.0.note_count = notes.size();
    return ALL;
}
function void clean() { packets = 0; previousReceipt = createDate(1970,1,1,"UTC"); ballots = 0D; backwardPackets = 0L; clear(notes); }
```

