Group accumulator (all fields have no metadata defaults):
```xml
<Metadata id="accumulator">
<Record name="TrenchAcc" type="delimited">
  <Field name="catalogued" type="integer" nullable="false" delimiter=";"/>
  <Field name="mass" type="decimal" nullable="false" delimiter=";"/>
</Record>
</Metadata>
```

Specification:
1. Summarize contiguous non-empty archaeological-trench groups; excavated_at is strictly later than 2000-01-01 UTC and mass is non-null and nonnegative.
2. Emit one final row per trench and no per-input output. latest_excavation is the greatest actual excavated_at in that trench, with an epoch baseline only for the maximum calculation.
3. catalogued counts non-null catalogued_at strictly later than excavated_at; null catalogue time contributes zero. mass is the current-trench sum.
4. Null tags count as missing_tags; non-null tags count as tagged and append to the tag collection, preserving duplicates and empty strings. tag_entries is the collection length.
5. Keep groups independent by resetting all module group state and relying on the non-nullable accumulator reset values. Copy trench unchanged.

```ctl
//#CTL2
integer tagged;
date latestExcavation;
long missingTags;
string[] tagTexts;
function void initGroup(TrenchAcc acc) { tagged = 0; missingTags = 0L; clear(tagTexts); }
function boolean updateGroup(TrenchAcc acc) {
    if ($in.0.excavated_at > latestExcavation) latestExcavation = $in.0.excavated_at;
    if ($in.0.tag == null) missingTags++;
    else { tagged++; append(tagTexts, $in.0.tag); }
    if ($in.0.catalogued_at > $in.0.excavated_at) acc.catalogued++;
    acc.mass = acc.mass + $in.0.mass;
    return false;
}
function boolean finishGroup(TrenchAcc acc) { return true; }
function integer updateTransform(integer counter, TrenchAcc acc) { return SKIP; }
function integer transform(integer counter, TrenchAcc acc) {
    if (counter > 0) return SKIP;
    $out.0.trench = $in.0.trench;
    $out.0.latest_excavation = latestExcavation;
    $out.0.catalogued = acc.catalogued;
    $out.0.mass = acc.mass;
    $out.0.tagged = tagged;
    $out.0.missing_tags = missingTags + 1L;
    $out.0.tag_entries = size(tagTexts);
    return ALL;
}
```

