Output port 0:
```xml
<Metadata id="out0">
<Record name="LineReport" type="delimited">
  <Field name="line" type="string" nullable="false"/>
  <Field name="last_tap" type="date" nullable="false"/>
  <Field name="taps" type="integer" nullable="false"/>
  <Field name="fare_total" type="decimal" nullable="false"/>
  <Field name="without_voucher" type="integer" nullable="false"/>
  <Field name="zones" type="integer" nullable="false"/>
</Record>
</Metadata>
```
Group accumulator (no metadata default values):
```xml
<Metadata id="acc">
<Record name="FareAcc" type="delimited">
  <Field name="without_voucher" type="integer" nullable="false"/>
</Record>
</Metadata>
```

Specification:
1. Groups are non-empty; line and zone are non-empty, tap_at is non-null and later than 2020-01-01 UTC.
2. Emit exactly one final report per line, no update-phase reports. Copy line unchanged.
3. last_tap is the greatest tap_at of this line only. Reset all per-line module counters, zone list, and date state between lines.
4. taps is the exact input-row count. fare_total is the sum of fare with null fare contributing zero, rounded to two decimal places.
5. without_voucher counts rows whose voucher is null. zones counts distinct zone strings within this line. The non-nullable accumulator count has no metadata default.

```ctl
//#CTL2
integer taps;
date lastTap;
decimal fareTotal;
string[] zones;
function void initGroup(FareAcc acc) {
    taps = 0;
    fareTotal = 0D;
    clear(zones);
}
function boolean updateGroup(FareAcc acc) {
    if ($in.0.tap_at > lastTap) lastTap = $in.0.tap_at;
    taps++;
    if ($in.0.voucher == null) acc.without_voucher++;
    fareTotal = fareTotal + $in.0.fare;
    if (!containsValue(zones, $in.0.zone)) append(zones, $in.0.zone);
    return false;
}
function boolean finishGroup(FareAcc acc) { return true; }
function integer updateTransform(integer counter, FareAcc acc) { return SKIP; }
function integer transform(integer counter, FareAcc acc) {
    if (counter > 0) return SKIP;
    $out.0.line = $in.0.line;
    $out.0.last_tap = lastTap;
    $out.0.taps = taps + 1;
    $out.0.fare_total = round(fareTotal, "2");
    $out.0.without_voucher = acc.without_voucher;
    $out.0.zones = length(zones);
    return ALL;
}
```

